    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the <ref refid="class_point_map" kindref="compound">PointMap</ref> class for discrete points in a <ref refid="class_map" kindref="compound">Map</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file contains the <ref refid="class_point_map" kindref="compound">PointMap</ref> class, which represents a point in the discrete coordinate space of a <ref refid="class_map" kindref="compound">Map</ref>. It provides access to axis values, comparison operators, and serialization support. </para>
